** Maximum potential critical strike damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*2+100*1.1*2*0.65*2}}}}% AD}}|(110% + 71.5%{{times}}2){{times}}2}}
** Maximum potential critical strike damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}} and {{ii|Infinity Edge}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|{{#expr:100*1.1*(2+0.3)+100*1.1*(2+0.3)*0.65*2}}}}% AD}}|(110% + 71.5%{{times}}2){{times}}2.3}}
